WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.480
Kip climbed down the tree.

2
00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:28.218
"Bird is my best friend," said Kip.

3
00:00:28.219 --> 00:00:34.347
"But she is keeping secrets from me."

4
00:00:34.348 --> 00:00:39.331
A cold wind blew.

5
00:00:39.332 --> 00:00:44.308
Kip shivered.

6
00:00:44.309 --> 00:00:49.842
"I'm angry at Bird," he said.

7
00:00:49.843 --> 00:00:57.236
"I'm going to find a new friend!"

8
00:00:57.237 --> 00:01:04.430
Squirrel was waiting to cross the bike path.

9
00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:10.472
"Squirrel and I both gather acorns," said Kip.

10
00:01:10.473 --> 00:01:20.005
"I'll be friends with Squirrel."

11
00:01:20.006 --> 00:01:23.150
"Hi, Squirrel," said Kip.

12
00:01:23.151 --> 00:01:26.973
"Do you want to gather acorns together?"

13
00:01:26.974 --> 00:01:30.028
"No thanks," said Squirrel.

14
00:01:30.029 --> 00:01:46.049
"I have enough acorns."

15
00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:49.019
Frog was jumping to the pond.

16
00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:53.793
"I like to jump too," said Kip.

17
00:01:53.794 --> 00:01:57.145
"I'll be friends with Frog."

18
00:01:57.146 --> 00:01:59.939
"Hi, Frog," said Kip.

19
00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:07.431
"Do you want to jump around with me?"

20
00:02:07.432 --> 00:02:11.860
"Maybe in the spring," said Frog.

21
00:02:11.861 --> 00:02:21.462
"I'm going to sleep for the winter."

22
00:02:21.463 --> 00:02:27.281
"This is terrible," cried Kip.

23
00:02:27.282 --> 00:02:31.799
"Bird is keeping secrets from me.

24
00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:42.201
And I can't find a new friend!"

